type: software
title: "Fatigue-Detector-Rehab: an adaptive fatigue detection model for virtual reality-based physical therapy"
abstract: "Machine learning model that estimates the level of fatigue (low, moderate, high and very high) during the Box and Block exercise in the Rehab-Immersive system, together with utilities for exercise data analysis and report generation."
